{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23576","headline":"岁日家宴戏示弟侄等兼呈张侍御二十八丈殷判官二十三兄 · 白居易","name":"岁日家宴戏示弟侄等兼呈张侍御二十八丈殷判官二十三兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弟妹妻孥小侄甥，娇痴弄我助欢情。\n岁盏後推蓝尾酒，春盘先劝胶牙饧。\n形骸潦到虽堪叹，骨肉团圆亦可荣。\n犹有夸张少年处，笑呼张丈唤殷兄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}